  <description value="Domain-semantic subtype classifications for a MolecularDefinition resource instance, providing greater specificity than the moleculeType element. For example, an instance with moleculeType 'rna' may have a type of 'mrna' or 'mirna'. This ValueSet is an enumerated, curated set of locally-defined codes covering clinically relevant DNA and RNA subtypes. The binding is extensible: implementers may use codes from other systems when no suitable code exists in this set."/>
